  clock: 3  # bd8d
  nonce: bd8d  # bd8d
  message: "2026-10-10 docstring audit, two latent defects in serve_duress for when the auth modules are wired: (1) call_on_duress_login catches only asyncio.TimeoutError (~145), so a handler that raises propagates ValueError; (2) load_duress_handler silently returns the no-op handler on any import error or missing path, with no warning. Also serve_auth_config (AuthConfig.from_dict) has no production caller and load_config ignores the auth section. Docstrings now say these modules are unwired."  # bd8d
